
graph TB
Start([开始]) --> Init[index.ts 导出渲染器实例]
Init --> HostConnect[host.ts 连接设计器]
subgraph 初始化阶段
HostConnect --> CreateContainer[创建 SimulatorRendererContainer]
CreateContainer --> InitMobX[启用 MobX 响应式]
InitMobX --> ConnectHost[连接 host 建立双向通信]
ConnectHost --> SyncConfig[同步配置: layout/components/designMode/device/locale]
SyncConfig --> CreateHistory[创建内存路由 MemoryHistory]
CreateHistory --> ListenDocs[监听文档列表变化]
ListenDocs --> InitContext[初始化应用上下文]
InitContext --> LoadComponents[消费组件资源]
end
LoadComponents --> RunRenderer[调用 run 启动渲染器]
subgraph 渲染阶段
RunRenderer --> CreateDOM[创建 DOM 容器 #app]
CreateDOM --> RenderRoot[渲染根组件 SimulatorRendererView]
RenderRoot --> Router[Router: 内存路由容器]
Router --> Layout{Layout: 是否有布局配置?}
Layout -->|是| ApplyLayout[应用布局组件]
Layout -->|否| Fragment[使用 Fragment]
ApplyLayout --> Routes
Fragment --> Routes[Routes: 路由配置]
Routes --> MapDocs[遍历文档实例]
MapDocs --> CreateRoute[为每个文档创建 Route]
CreateRoute --> RendererComp[Renderer: 核心渲染组件]
end
subgraph Schema渲染阶段
RendererComp --> CheckRender{检查是否允许渲染?}
CheckRender -->|否| ReturnNull[返回 null]
CheckRender -->|是| GetSchema[从 DocumentInstance 获取 Schema]
GetSchema --> LowCodeRenderer[LowCodeRenderer: 低代码渲染器]
LowCodeRenderer --> TraverseSchema[遍历 Schema 树]
TraverseSchema --> CustomCreate[customCreateElement: 自定义创建元素]
CustomCreate --> Extract[提取 __id 和其他属性]
Extract --> GetNode[从 documentInstance 获取节点]
GetNode --> CheckContainer{是否为空容器?}
CheckContainer -->|是| AddPlaceholder[添加占位符]
CheckContainer -->|否| InterceptEvents[拦截设计态事件]
AddPlaceholder --> InterceptEvents
InterceptEvents --> CheckLock{是否锁定?}
CheckLock -->|是| ShowLockMsg[显示锁定提示]
CheckLock -->|否| CheckATag{是否为 a 标签?}
ShowLockMsg --> CheckATag
CheckATag -->|是| RemoveHref[移除 href 防止跳转]
CheckATag -->|否| CheckMenu{是否为 Menu?}
RemoveHref --> CheckMenu
CheckMenu -->|是| IgnoreEvents[忽略所有事件]
CheckMenu -->|否| ValidateComp[验证组件有效性]
IgnoreEvents --> ValidateComp
ValidateComp --> CreateElement[createElement 创建实际元素]
CreateElement --> GetRef[onCompGetRef: 获取组件引用]
GetRef --> MountInstance[documentInstance.mountInstance挂载实例]
end
subgraph 实例挂载阶段
MountInstance --> CheckNull{instance 是否为 null?}
CheckNull -->|是| UnmountLogic[卸载逻辑: 过滤已卸载实例]
CheckNull -->|否| CheckReuse{是否复用其他节点实例?}
CheckReuse -->|是| UnmountOld[从原节点卸载]
CheckReuse -->|否| CheckElement{是否为 DOM 元素?}
UnmountOld --> CheckElement
CheckElement -->|是| CacheKey[缓存 React 内部 key]
CheckElement -->|否| HijackUnmount[劫持 componentWillUnmount]
CacheKey --> MarkSymbol[标记 SYMBOL_VNID 和 SYMBOL_VDID]
HijackUnmount --> MarkSymbol
MarkSymbol --> UpdateMap[更新 instancesMap]
UpdateMap --> NotifyHost[通知 host.setInstance]
UnmountLogic --> NotifyHost
end
NotifyHost --> RecordTime[记录渲染时间]
RecordTime --> EmitEvent[发送性能监控事件]
EmitTime --> SetReady[通知设计器渲染就绪]
SetReady --> End([渲染完成])
